(2229980, 306207, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand the title. I like this because of the blurred figure, the warm quality of the light and the area of bright color in contrast to the overall neutral tones. This isn''t the kind of thing that tends to do well in the voting, however. It appeals to me, though.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand the title. I like this because of the blurred figure, the warm quality of the light and the area of bright color in contrast to the overall neutral tones. This isn''t the kind of thing that tends to do well in the voting, however. It appeals to me, though.', '2006-03-15 10:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
