(2230765, 304690, 33947, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT!!! Great composition, great cropping. FUN water!! A pleasure to see a different style. 10</td>', 'LOVE IT!!! Great composition, great cropping. FUN water!! A pleasure to see a different style. 10', '2006-03-15 14:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2230766, 304707, 23913, '<td valign="top">the mirror was a good ides, but IMO the angle is wrong and the reflection of the black sheet shows all to clearly.<br/> <br/>next time to use this affect try a long exposure with verry dim light so that the sheet does not show but blacks out. i used basicaly the same technique for my paint with light submition sheet, mirror and all. but the light was so focused and dim that it didn''t show in the reflection. (the sheet i used was actualy blue also)<br/> <br/>you had the right idea and good instinced. give it another shot you don''t need much and this would be a really dynamic image.<br/> <br/>also shoot from the front of the shoes so the heel and underside arn''t so strong in the image. oh and try using glass in place of the mirror its not quite as reflective place it on top of you black cloth and the try you lighting just a desk lamp or somthing, you will be shocked.<br/> <br/>GL and keep at it.</td>', 'the mirror was a good ides, but IMO the angle is wrong and the reflection of the black sheet shows all to clearly. next time to use this affect try a long exposure with verry dim light so that the sheet does not show but blacks out. i used basicaly the same technique for my paint with light submition sheet, mirror and all. but the light was so focused and dim that it didn''t show in the reflection. (the sheet i used was actualy blue also) you had the right idea and good instinced. give it another shot you don''t need much and this would be a really dynamic image. also shoot from the front of the shoes so the heel and underside arn''t so strong in the image. oh and try using glass in place of the mirror its not quite as reflective place it on top of you black cloth and the try you lighting just a desk lamp or somthing, you will be shocked. GL and keep at it.', '2006-03-15 14:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2230773, 304911, 23913, '<td valign="top">i would like to see this cropped for less of the leg, rule of thirds, and elimanation of the other leg from the frame. also would be nice to have a clean&amp;clear stop motion of the water.</td>', 'i would like to see this cropped for less of the leg, rule of thirds, and elimanation of the other leg from the frame. also would be nice to have a clean&clear stop motion of the water.', '2006-03-15 14:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2230785, 305280, 23913, '<td valign="top">cool, or cold, one of those.<br/> <br/>nice shot, verry different from the rest of the challenge. could even be an REI add or something like that, but (there''s always a but huh) i think the choice of having the hand i the back pocket was a bad 1. if it were in the jacket pocket would be better (IMO) or if it were in the front pocket of the jeans it would be ok-slightly better.<br/> <br/>thats my only prob. like the framing  and it hits right about in the rule of thirds so over all nice image very cool/cold and different good to see that!</td>', 'cool, or cold, one of those. nice shot, verry different from the rest of the challenge. could even be an REI add or something like that, but (there''s always a but huh) i think the choice of having the hand i the back pocket was a bad 1. if it were in the jacket pocket would be better (IMO) or if it were in the front pocket of the jeans it would be ok-slightly better. thats my only prob. like the framing  and it hits right about in the rule of thirds so over all nice image very cool/cold and different good to see that!', '2006-03-15 14:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
