(2230794, 304388, 23913, '<td valign="top">the framing on this is a little odd its not quite center (or maybe it is ment to be) and its not quite fill or for that matter rule of thirds or any of that. its a great idea and a good shot, maybe utilizing DoF more would help give it a stronger focal point and really add so punch to a very cool (dizzingly so) image.</td>', 'the framing on this is a little odd its not quite center (or maybe it is ment to be) and its not quite fill or for that matter rule of thirds or any of that. its a great idea and a good shot, maybe utilizing DoF more would help give it a stronger focal point and really add so punch to a very cool (dizzingly so) image.', '2006-03-15 14:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
