(2231143, 306089, 34217, '<td valign="top">If you are going to shoot something on a mirror, make sure what is reflecting is not to busy.  The plants in this photo is really discracting.  Shooting on a mirror or black glass is not easy for this reason.</td>', 'If you are going to shoot something on a mirror, make sure what is reflecting is not to busy.  The plants in this photo is really discracting.  Shooting on a mirror or black glass is not easy for this reason.', '2006-03-15 16:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
