(2231150, 306832, 34217, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the light is terrible.  It is too harsh.  It would have been neat to create a sublte spotlight effect it would have maybe added some drama to your picture.  The number on thing that will make your shots more professional is how they are lit, it is an important skill to master.  Heck I am still working on it, but it is the main focus of most of my shots</td>', 'I like the concept, but the light is terrible.  It is too harsh.  It would have been neat to create a sublte spotlight effect it would have maybe added some drama to your picture.  The number on thing that will make your shots more professional is how they are lit, it is an important skill to master.  Heck I am still working on it, but it is the main focus of most of my shots', '2006-03-15 16:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
