(2231299, 305918, 45620, '<td valign="top">... and it is just getting started... nothing sexier than a well dressed man... except, well - anyway - this is a nice shot. Good use of angles nice reptilian draping of the tie and no distractions from the subject. Back and white heightens the subjects importance and the lighting shows off the natural wear of the shoes. Good job!</td>', '... and it is just getting started... nothing sexier than a well dressed man... except, well - anyway - this is a nice shot. Good use of angles nice reptilian draping of the tie and no distractions from the subject. Back and white heightens the subjects importance and the lighting shows off the natural wear of the shoes. Good job!', '2006-03-15 17:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
