(2231658, 306467, 45620, '<td valign="top">looks like a commercial shot - it begs the question of "How??" These shoes have definite character - nice subject!</td>', 'looks like a commercial shot - it begs the question of "How??" These shoes have definite character - nice subject!', '2006-03-15 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
