(2231664, 306609, 45620, '<td valign="top">nothing spectacular - nice baby shoes - the laces are the most engaging part of the shot - maybe laying the camera on the floor and shooting up a little would make less shadow and more art...? who knows</td>', 'nothing spectacular - nice baby shoes - the laces are the most engaging part of the shot - maybe laying the camera on the floor and shooting up a little would make less shadow and more art...? who knows', '2006-03-15 20:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231666, 304846, 45620, '<td valign="top">Love it - the off center subject with a cool horse and nice textured sand really makes for a nice shot.... I did not even notice the boot at first - just the stirrup - great lighing effects... wonderful composition</td>', 'Love it - the off center subject with a cool horse and nice textured sand really makes for a nice shot.... I did not even notice the boot at first - just the stirrup - great lighing effects... wonderful composition', '2006-03-15 20:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231668, 306165, 45620, '<td valign="top">oooooh - love the stillness of the boots in the cascades of water - a slightly faster shutterspeed may have made this a little bit better - but kudos on the shot.</td>', 'oooooh - love the stillness of the boots in the cascades of water - a slightly faster shutterspeed may have made this a little bit better - but kudos on the shot.', '2006-03-15 20:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231671, 306394, 45620, '<td valign="top">Gross! yuck ick! I do not like feet - at all, and I do not like slimy colored feet - but this is an engaging picture - great angles, color and use of lighting - high scores for you - but ICKY for me</td>', 'Gross! yuck ick! I do not like feet - at all, and I do not like slimy colored feet - but this is an engaging picture - great angles, color and use of lighting - high scores for you - but ICKY for me', '2006-03-15 20:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231674, 306828, 45620, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and angles - kind of boring though - no story to engage the viewer</td>', 'nice lighting and angles - kind of boring though - no story to engage the viewer', '2006-03-15 20:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231676, 305060, 45620, '<td valign="top">the hairy leg became the subject instead of the footwear - I love the composition idea though - very creative. The red in the background is distracting and the lighting is odd, but still a great idea</td>', 'the hairy leg became the subject instead of the footwear - I love the composition idea though - very creative. The red in the background is distracting and the lighting is odd, but still a great idea', '2006-03-15 20:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231681, 304911, 45620, '<td valign="top">The shutter speed made this shot too soft for an artsy picture. Also the focus is on the water instead of the footwear. Great idea though!</td>', 'The shutter speed made this shot too soft for an artsy picture. Also the focus is on the water instead of the footwear. Great idea though!', '2006-03-15 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231683, 306774, 45620, '<td valign="top">very nice! beautiful use of black and white - very believable pose - lovely backdrop and good cropping. Kudos to you!</td>', 'very nice! beautiful use of black and white - very believable pose - lovely backdrop and good cropping. Kudos to you!', '2006-03-15 20:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231686, 304690, 45620, '<td valign="top">So funky it doesn''t even look like a picture - just an ad of some sort. Love the color scheme - love the angles - love the lines - nice job</td>', 'So funky it doesn''t even look like a picture - just an ad of some sort. Love the color scheme - love the angles - love the lines - nice job', '2006-03-15 20:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231691, 306089, 45620, '<td valign="top">nice idea to use the mirror - I love the pink and green - more foilage would have kept the focus on the subject.</td>', 'nice idea to use the mirror - I love the pink and green - more foilage would have kept the focus on the subject.', '2006-03-15 20:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231697, 306010, 45620, '<td valign="top">definitely makes you want to engage in some serious winter sports! Way cool backdrop on this shot - could almost make it black and white and not make much of a difference. I like the depth and although I would straighten up that ski? to intersect the difference in texture of mountain ranges - this is a good composition</td>', 'definitely makes you want to engage in some serious winter sports! Way cool backdrop on this shot - could almost make it black and white and not make much of a difference. I like the depth and although I would straighten up that ski? to intersect the difference in texture of mountain ranges - this is a good composition', '2006-03-15 20:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231699, 306821, 45620, '<td valign="top">She is a little too old to have her boots on the wrong feet - great idea for a composition - the background is not quite thick enough to keep distractions at bay and the focus is not quite on - maybe you could have gotten her expression in by shooting from her boots up?</td>', 'She is a little too old to have her boots on the wrong feet - great idea for a composition - the background is not quite thick enough to keep distractions at bay and the focus is not quite on - maybe you could have gotten her expression in by shooting from her boots up?', '2006-03-15 20:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231700, 305172, 45620, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah! Makes me want to see just how cold that water is for wading! The tied boot kind of messes with my mind though - most people do not tie their boots neatly and then toss them on a rock and run off. (smile) REally good use of color - nice composition</td>', 'Oh yeah! Makes me want to see just how cold that water is for wading! The tied boot kind of messes with my mind though - most people do not tie their boots neatly and then toss them on a rock and run off. (smile) REally good use of color - nice composition', '2006-03-15 20:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231702, 304983, 45620, '<td valign="top">Too chaotic - no subject stands out at all - I like pictures to have a point or story behind them</td>', 'Too chaotic - no subject stands out at all - I like pictures to have a point or story behind them', '2006-03-15 20:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231704, 305357, 45620, '<td valign="top">Very lovely clouds - the rippling water adds to the effect and the low key lighing is perfect for anticipation... Good composition</td>', 'Very lovely clouds - the rippling water adds to the effect and the low key lighing is perfect for anticipation... Good composition', '2006-03-15 20:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231707, 305811, 45620, '<td valign="top">Love this shot - <br/>Awesome angle to shoot from and the cobalt sky shows just how bright it was out - and just happens to match the blue on his jacket - really nice job!</td>', 'Love this shot - Awesome angle to shoot from and the cobalt sky shows just how bright it was out - and just happens to match the blue on his jacket - really nice job!', '2006-03-15 20:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231710, 306641, 45620, '<td valign="top">Good use of color and texture - the floor is the focal poing though</td>', 'Good use of color and texture - the floor is the focal poing though', '2006-03-15 20:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231711, 306791, 45620, '<td valign="top">I like the color scheme - blue and brown are nice - the eyelet almost looks like a turtles eye or something - funky - keep it up</td>', 'I like the color scheme - blue and brown are nice - the eyelet almost looks like a turtles eye or something - funky - keep it up', '2006-03-15 20:26:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2231712, 306952, 45620, '<td valign="top">lighting is too low on this shot - it is grainy... the red is kind of distracting, but I love the cat... good idea</td>', 'lighting is too low on this shot - it is grainy... the red is kind of distracting, but I love the cat... good idea', '2006-03-15 20:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231715, 306786, 45620, '<td valign="top">kind of soft focus - the focal poing of this picture tends to be the calloused heel - maybe a different crop?</td>', 'kind of soft focus - the focal poing of this picture tends to be the calloused heel - maybe a different crop?', '2006-03-15 20:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231720, 306633, 45620, '<td valign="top">Way funky lighting - love the pose and the composition  - just too much light for me</td>', 'Way funky lighting - love the pose and the composition  - just too much light for me', '2006-03-15 20:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231723, 305143, 45620, '<td valign="top">Powerful emotions playing on the faces - intense - makes me wonder if when that shoe flies free if I will get hit - nice composition, angles, lighting and focus. You are my pick!!!</td>', 'Powerful emotions playing on the faces - intense - makes me wonder if when that shoe flies free if I will get hit - nice composition, angles, lighting and focus. You are my pick!!!', '2006-03-15 20:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231725, 306209, 15711, '<td valign="top">CUTE. There was a display in Country Living Magazine layout with a similar image.  My main gripe is the fish.  I wish they were cloned out and the boots appeared more plain.</td>', 'CUTE. There was a display in Country Living Magazine layout with a similar image.  My main gripe is the fish.  I wish they were cloned out and the boots appeared more plain.', '2006-03-15 20:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231727, 306501, 45620, '<td valign="top">wow - so much texture - good use of angles - the nail polish isn''t very real looking - there should be a drop about to drip - this picture looks like she does not want nail polish on her toes and would be upset to have it accidentally get on her -</td>', 'wow - so much texture - good use of angles - the nail polish isn''t very real looking - there should be a drop about to drip - this picture looks like she does not want nail polish on her toes and would be upset to have it accidentally get on her -', '2006-03-15 20:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231729, 304769, 45620, '<td valign="top">Very cool ighting and color use! I love the aged subjects - they have so much character and history - nice - very very nice</td>', 'Very cool ighting and color use! I love the aged subjects - they have so much character and history - nice - very very nice', '2006-03-15 20:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231739, 305500, 45620, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what the poles in the middle are for and that is quite disconcerting - the boots are really full of a story waiting to be told - the foilage adds a nice touch - the undone carelessly tossed laces are great - but the poles throw it all out of whack... High score though - just not a 10</td>', 'I am not sure what the poles in the middle are for and that is quite disconcerting - the boots are really full of a story waiting to be told - the foilage adds a nice touch - the undone carelessly tossed laces are great - but the poles throw it all out of whack... High score though - just not a 10', '2006-03-15 20:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231750, 306222, 15992, '<td valign="top">nice.</td>', 'nice.', '2006-03-15 20:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231752, 305439, 45620, '<td valign="top">gross - oh, I get it now - what a creative idea for a composition- a little bit better focus and maybe purple jelly shoes and this would have worked more easily. The napkin behind is a little distracting just because of the symetry of the pattern and it not being straight or flat. I think that moving everything a little closer together would have helped bring this composition together</td>', 'gross - oh, I get it now - what a creative idea for a composition- a little bit better focus and maybe purple jelly shoes and this would have worked more easily. The napkin behind is a little distracting just because of the symetry of the pattern and it not being straight or flat. I think that moving everything a little closer together would have helped bring this composition together', '2006-03-15 20:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231763, 305862, 45620, '<td valign="top">Oh my! I am glad that is not my daughter! I really think you could have saved this picture for a "got milk" challenge or something. Really and truly - all jokes aside I think that this is NOT really an appropriate picture. It has good lighting and nice lines, but the subject happens to be the breasts by default and that overrides any good qualities the picture has going for it. Two thumbs down</td>', 'Oh my! I am glad that is not my daughter! I really think you could have saved this picture for a "got milk" challenge or something. Really and truly - all jokes aside I think that this is NOT really an appropriate picture. It has good lighting and nice lines, but the subject happens to be the breasts by default and that overrides any good qualities the picture has going for it. Two thumbs down', '2006-03-15 20:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231764, 305690, 45620, '<td valign="top">Too much shadow - try using natural light from a window</td>', 'Too much shadow - try using natural light from a window', '2006-03-15 20:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2231769, 305958, 45620, '<td valign="top">Foreground is too distracting and the subject is not worth looking for. Maybe get a little closer to the subject and add some contrast?</td>', 'Foreground is too distracting and the subject is not worth looking for. Maybe get a little closer to the subject and add some contrast?', '2006-03-15 20:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
