(2232133, 306896, 34217, '<td valign="top">I am sorry to say this, but if you are going to photograph feet please make sure they have been pedicured at least.  No one wants to look at feet that are not beautiful.  No offense to your foot model, my feet look the same, but that does not mean that I want to look at them or photograph them.  Cute tat though</td>', 'I am sorry to say this, but if you are going to photograph feet please make sure they have been pedicured at least.  No one wants to look at feet that are not beautiful.  No offense to your foot model, my feet look the same, but that does not mean that I want to look at them or photograph them.  Cute tat though', '2006-03-15 23:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2232137, 305500, 55005, '<td valign="top">I like it, although I find background rather distracting and the spot on the right boot a bit too bright.</td>', 'I like it, although I find background rather distracting and the spot on the right boot a bit too bright.', '2006-03-15 23:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
