(2233052, 306485, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice shoes.  Shooting black objects can be a challenge, as they can end up being non-descript, as in this case.  It would probably be better to have at least one shoe in profile, and expose for as much shoe detail (eyelets/laces) as possible.  Black strapy sandals would be easier to shoot simply because they start with much more visible detail.</td>', 'Nice shoes.  Shooting black objects can be a challenge, as they can end up being non-descript, as in this case.  It would probably be better to have at least one shoe in profile, and expose for as much shoe detail (eyelets/laces) as possible.  Black strapy sandals would be easier to shoot simply because they start with much more visible detail.', '2006-03-16 10:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233060, 306942, 49109, '<td valign="top">not bad for a kiddie shot, a tad oversaturated</td>', 'not bad for a kiddie shot, a tad oversaturated', '2006-03-16 10:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233071, 306636, 49109, '<td valign="top">would have left more space on left and less on right to emphasize the feeling of her going away, besides that a nice portrait</td>', 'would have left more space on left and less on right to emphasize the feeling of her going away, besides that a nice portrait', '2006-03-16 10:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233092, 305587, 54610, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and contrast.  Well done. 7</td>', 'Nice colors and contrast.  Well done. 7', '2006-03-16 10:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233104, 306686, 51793, '<td valign="top">Need more light on the shoes. It''s too hard to see them. try using a soft like like 30 watts with a red cloth on it to dim it. this would bring out the red more and brighten up the shoes.</td>', 'Need more light on the shoes. It''s too hard to see them. try using a soft like like 30 watts with a red cloth on it to dim it. this would bring out the red more and brighten up the shoes.', '2006-03-16 10:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233108, 306394, 51793, '<td valign="top">this is just nasty looking.</td>', 'this is just nasty looking.', '2006-03-16 10:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233111, 306832, 51793, '<td valign="top">I wonder if the store owner was mad that you did this, haha this is a good pic because you actually went to a store to take this picture.</td>', 'I wonder if the store owner was mad that you did this, haha this is a good pic because you actually went to a store to take this picture.', '2006-03-16 10:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233130, 305290, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Focus on central part and/or more DOF/sharpness would be better.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Focus on central part and/or more DOF/sharpness would be better.', '2006-03-16 10:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233158, 304562, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement.  Processing (curves) has resulted in interesting colors, but unfortunately also loss of detail, especially in the mule.  Preserving the detail would be better.</td>', 'Nice arrangement.  Processing (curves) has resulted in interesting colors, but unfortunately also loss of detail, especially in the mule.  Preserving the detail would be better.', '2006-03-16 10:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233182, 305069, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Since "Footwear" is the challenge, more illumination on the shoes would be better - try fill flash and/or level adjustment to bring the shoes out of the darkness.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Since "Footwear" is the challenge, more illumination on the shoes would be better - try fill flash and/or level adjustment to bring the shoes out of the darkness.', '2006-03-16 11:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233188, 305102, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the moment.  Somewhat blown out where it counts on the shoes, and sharper would be better (higher shutter speed, longer lens/less crop).  But the title and image made me smile.</td>', 'Nice capture of the moment.  Somewhat blown out where it counts on the shoes, and sharper would be better (higher shutter speed, longer lens/less crop).  But the title and image made me smile.', '2006-03-16 11:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233190, 306416, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice boots and fishnets.  More illumination and separation from the background would be better.</td>', 'Nice boots and fishnets.  More illumination and separation from the background would be better.', '2006-03-16 11:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233191, 305342, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Overall image is too gray, brighter levels would be better.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Overall image is too gray, brighter levels would be better.', '2006-03-16 11:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233195, 306318, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and pretty good execution.  Sharpness on face (focus / more DOF) would be better.</td>', 'Nice composition and pretty good execution.  Sharpness on face (focus / more DOF) would be better.', '2006-03-16 11:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233225, 305439, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good humorous idea.  Focus on jellies (seems to be on glass), more DOF and a plain background would be better.</td>', 'Good humorous idea.  Focus on jellies (seems to be on glass), more DOF and a plain background would be better.', '2006-03-16 11:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233247, 304435, 44490, '<td valign="top">This composition makes the upper part dominant, but this fights against the shallow DOF for the Timberland label.  Would probably be better to give up on the shallow DOF, use more DOF to get the whole sole sharp, crank up yellow/saturation to make the label stand out.</td>', 'This composition makes the upper part dominant, but this fights against the shallow DOF for the Timberland label.  Would probably be better to give up on the shallow DOF, use more DOF to get the whole sole sharp, crank up yellow/saturation to make the label stand out.', '2006-03-16 11:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233249, 305584, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Sharper with more DOF and without the table would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Sharper with more DOF and without the table would be better.', '2006-03-16 11:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233250, 306871, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, just a little more DOF would be better in my opinion, to have more of the photo in focus, and still have contrast with parts out-of-focus.</td>', 'Nice composition, just a little more DOF would be better in my opinion, to have more of the photo in focus, and still have contrast with parts out-of-focus.', '2006-03-16 11:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233256, 306305, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, sandal, and french pedicure.  Image is just too dark, brighter levels would be an easy fix in Photoshop.</td>', 'Nice composition, sandal, and french pedicure.  Image is just too dark, brighter levels would be an easy fix in Photoshop.', '2006-03-16 11:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233269, 305357, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition.  Better illumination of the shoe would be better for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition.  Better illumination of the shoe would be better for this challenge.', '2006-03-16 11:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233272, 305810, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Weeds are distracting.  Tighter arrangement, B&amp;W, and/or more uniform/plain background would be better with attention concentrated on the major elements.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Weeds are distracting.  Tighter arrangement, B&W, and/or more uniform/plain background would be better with attention concentrated on the major elements.', '2006-03-16 11:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233279, 306666, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The quilt background is a little too busy.  Larger image would be better, please make larger dimension 640 pixels - see Learn &gt; Tutorials &gt; Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The quilt background is a little too busy.  Larger image would be better, please make larger dimension 640 pixels - see Learn > Tutorials > Using Photoshop to Prepare Photos for DPC Challenges.', '2006-03-16 11:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233289, 306706, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great idea - made me smile, thanks!</td>', 'Great idea - made me smile, thanks!', '2006-03-16 11:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233313, 304846, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Backfocus shows sharp hoofprints, focus and more illumination on boot and stirrup would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Backfocus shows sharp hoofprints, focus and more illumination on boot and stirrup would be better.', '2006-03-16 11:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233318, 306180, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and striking pattern.  Tighter crop would be better, and finding a more interesting not-so-central compostion is a challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea and striking pattern.  Tighter crop would be better, and finding a more interesting not-so-central compostion is a challenge.', '2006-03-16 11:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233319, 306910, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement and composition.  Just needs better white balance, could easily be fixed in Photoshop by choosing a white in levels.</td>', 'Nice arrangement and composition.  Just needs better white balance, could easily be fixed in Photoshop by choosing a white in levels.', '2006-03-16 11:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233321, 305500, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Less distracting background and less symmetrical composition would be better, how about DOF separation from a distant background and angling one boot?</td>', 'Nice idea.  Less distracting background and less symmetrical composition would be better, how about DOF separation from a distant background and angling one boot?', '2006-03-16 11:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233327, 305060, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Would be better if you could match extreme range of subject distance with extreme DOF, i.e., focus/DOF on sole is primary, you have great sharpness everywhere else.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Would be better if you could match extreme range of subject distance with extreme DOF, i.e., focus/DOF on sole is primary, you have great sharpness everywhere else.', '2006-03-16 11:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233328, 306609, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement and compostion, cute soles.  Unfortunately blown out in the center, better to have detail here and slightly darker elsewhere.</td>', 'Nice arrangement and compostion, cute soles.  Unfortunately blown out in the center, better to have detail here and slightly darker elsewhere.', '2006-03-16 11:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233340, 305671, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition.  Consider bumping up saturation for a little color pop.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition.  Consider bumping up saturation for a little color pop.', '2006-03-16 11:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233345, 306668, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice humorous idea - made me smile, thanks!  Extreme DOF to include mic would be better.</td>', 'Nice humorous idea - made me smile, thanks!  Extreme DOF to include mic would be better.', '2006-03-16 11:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233348, 306274, 51793, '<td valign="top">This is a really cute idea. I can picture this happening. I give you a 10...</td>', 'This is a really cute idea. I can picture this happening. I give you a 10...', '2006-03-16 11:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233349, 306686, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and lovely arrangement.  More exposure/illumination would help.</td>', 'Nice idea and lovely arrangement.  More exposure/illumination would help.', '2006-03-16 11:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2233355, 306795, 51793, '<td valign="top">this is a neat idea.</td>', 'this is a neat idea.', '2006-03-16 11:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
