(2233863, 306885, 39349, '<td valign="top">First off, I like your idea, the arrangement of the foot ware and all useful toys around it is a thoughtful idea. I also see you went for the HIGH Key effect that seems to be so popular here at the DPC. I do like it overall, but the one thing hurting this shot IMHO is the wall around the mountain bike. It seems to have it''s own light source. I know that it doesn''t but so much of the detail on, in, and around the mountain bike is lost. This creates an unwanted distraction and a somewhat unbalanced feeling that my eye keeps being drawn toward. Overall a good step outside the box, good luck!</td>', 'First off, I like your idea, the arrangement of the foot ware and all useful toys around it is a thoughtful idea. I also see you went for the HIGH Key effect that seems to be so popular here at the DPC. I do like it overall, but the one thing hurting this shot IMHO is the wall around the mountain bike. It seems to have it''s own light source. I know that it doesn''t but so much of the detail on, in, and around the mountain bike is lost. This creates an unwanted distraction and a somewhat unbalanced feeling that my eye keeps being drawn toward. Overall a good step outside the box, good luck!', '2006-03-16 15:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
