(2234350, 304935, 31606, '<td valign="top">I wish I could add something that I think would improve this shot but I have looked at it now for about 10 minutes.  I just can''t find a damn thing wrong with it.  It really makes me want to go on vacation and feel the sand between my toes.  Bright beautiful colors and a very nice photo.  Composition is perfect.  This is my opinion is one of the best in this challenge.  Good luck and I hope it wins.</td>', 'I wish I could add something that I think would improve this shot but I have looked at it now for about 10 minutes.  I just can''t find a damn thing wrong with it.  It really makes me want to go on vacation and feel the sand between my toes.  Bright beautiful colors and a very nice photo.  Composition is perfect.  This is my opinion is one of the best in this challenge.  Good luck and I hope it wins.', '2006-03-16 19:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
