(2236700, 306701, 41574, '<td valign="top">As the focus here, really, is the shoes, I think the shot should have been exposed by an extra half-stop (or so). Nonetheless, I really like it.</td>', 'As the focus here, really, is the shoes, I think the shot should have been exposed by an extra half-stop (or so). Nonetheless, I really like it.', '2006-03-17 20:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2236702, 304628, 41574, '<td valign="top">The shot is totally under-exposed, expecially considering that the shoes are supposed to be the subject. I like the framing, but can''t forgive that I can''t really see what I''m (I think) supposed to be looking at. The thick black frame serves as a slight distraction from this flaw, but can only save the image so much.</td>', 'The shot is totally under-exposed, expecially considering that the shoes are supposed to be the subject. I like the framing, but can''t forgive that I can''t really see what I''m (I think) supposed to be looking at. The thick black frame serves as a slight distraction from this flaw, but can only save the image so much.', '2006-03-17 21:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2236703, 305540, 41574, '<td valign="top">So...you didn''t even care what the challenge''s theme was, did you?</td>', 'So...you didn''t even care what the challenge''s theme was, did you?', '2006-03-17 21:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
