(2237145, 306703, 17507, '<td valign="top">Cute, well exposed with good lighting, good processing . . . but for me, it''s a bit too contrived</td>', 'Cute, well exposed with good lighting, good processing . . . but for me, it''s a bit too contrived', '2006-03-18 05:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237147, 306916, 17507, '<td valign="top">where is the focal point?</td>', 'where is the focal point?', '2006-03-18 05:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237148, 306691, 17507, '<td valign="top">very strong except for the motion blur</td>', 'very strong except for the motion blur', '2006-03-18 05:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237149, 305644, 17507, '<td valign="top">the shoes have a tonal value too close to the rails to stand out well. if they were a true black this might have been an easier image to understand.</td>', 'the shoes have a tonal value too close to the rails to stand out well. if they were a true black this might have been an easier image to understand.', '2006-03-18 05:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237150, 306812, 17507, '<td valign="top">seems arbitrary - the reasoning behind snapping the shutter at this particular moment is unclear. very little to hold the eye.</td>', 'seems arbitrary - the reasoning behind snapping the shutter at this particular moment is unclear. very little to hold the eye.', '2006-03-18 05:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237151, 306206, 17507, '<td valign="top">great light. excellent technical control. I bet your feet appreciated the fresh air!</td>', 'great light. excellent technical control. I bet your feet appreciated the fresh air!', '2006-03-18 05:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237152, 306793, 17507, '<td valign="top">compositionally weak and lacking any apparent focal point, this image fails to grab me.</td>', 'compositionally weak and lacking any apparent focal point, this image fails to grab me.', '2006-03-18 05:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237154, 305343, 17507, '<td valign="top">supple indeed. good use of a studio environment. might have liked to see a bit more breathing room at the edges. the composition is not as strong as I feel it could be, though I''m not sure I could point exactly to how it might be improved.</td>', 'supple indeed. good use of a studio environment. might have liked to see a bit more breathing room at the edges. the composition is not as strong as I feel it could be, though I''m not sure I could point exactly to how it might be improved.', '2006-03-18 05:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237155, 305439, 17507, '<td valign="top">A bit more attention and care in the presentation would enhance the impact. The rumpled, distracting background does not help, and there was clearly no attempt to deal with the edge of the table. the light is harsh and flat, giving little sense of depth or form. not to mention that the very idea you have depicted here is improbably unrealistic and unappetizing.</td>', 'A bit more attention and care in the presentation would enhance the impact. The rumpled, distracting background does not help, and there was clearly no attempt to deal with the edge of the table. the light is harsh and flat, giving little sense of depth or form. not to mention that the very idea you have depicted here is improbably unrealistic and unappetizing.', '2006-03-18 05:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237157, 305863, 17507, '<td valign="top">with the expression on the guy''s face and the one-handed grip, this strikes me as quite weird.</td>', 'with the expression on the guy''s face and the one-handed grip, this strikes me as quite weird.', '2006-03-18 05:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237160, 305500, 17507, '<td valign="top">the focus is good and the worn boots hold promise as a photographic subject, but in this picture, I see poor use of light and tonality. the small hot spots on the boots are distracting, and the tones of the boots are too close to the surrounding to really stand out. the darkest tones are all in the background, which is distracting, and also causes the boots to look washed out. the subject of the photo is hugging the bottom of the frame, making the image look off-balance. no apparent compositional or conceptual purpose is served by the inclusion of so much space above the boots.</td>', 'the focus is good and the worn boots hold promise as a photographic subject, but in this picture, I see poor use of light and tonality. the small hot spots on the boots are distracting, and the tones of the boots are too close to the surrounding to really stand out. the darkest tones are all in the background, which is distracting, and also causes the boots to look washed out. the subject of the photo is hugging the bottom of the frame, making the image look off-balance. no apparent compositional or conceptual purpose is served by the inclusion of so much space above the boots.', '2006-03-18 05:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237161, 305356, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Not sure that so much space is really necessary on the sides. The blur on the left foot (camera right) is distracting me.</td>', 'I like the idea. Not sure that so much space is really necessary on the sides. The blur on the left foot (camera right) is distracting me.', '2006-03-18 05:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237163, 306832, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice collection. I think the placement of the photo is distracting, as it pulls attention waaay to the edge of the frame, far away from the sneakers that are the apparent intended focal point.</td>', 'nice collection. I think the placement of the photo is distracting, as it pulls attention waaay to the edge of the frame, far away from the sneakers that are the apparent intended focal point.', '2006-03-18 05:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237164, 306224, 17507, '<td valign="top">I think you could have brought out the blacks a bit more in this image and had a stronger impact as a result.</td>', 'I think you could have brought out the blacks a bit more in this image and had a stronger impact as a result.', '2006-03-18 05:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237166, 306485, 17507, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this fails to excite me on an aesthetic, emotional, conceptual, or intellectual level.</td>', 'I''m afraid this fails to excite me on an aesthetic, emotional, conceptual, or intellectual level.', '2006-03-18 05:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237167, 305542, 17507, '<td valign="top">interesting use of form and texture.</td>', 'interesting use of form and texture.', '2006-03-18 05:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237169, 306821, 17507, '<td valign="top">That sheet is screaming, "IRON ME!!!!"<br/> <br/>like "AHHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!"<br/> <br/>-- I strongly recommend getting the wrinkles out of your backdrop next time.</td>', 'That sheet is screaming, "IRON ME!!!!" like "AHHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!" -- I strongly recommend getting the wrinkles out of your backdrop next time.', '2006-03-18 05:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237170, 306642, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice tones. one of those accidents that turned out well? the perspective is unusual and refreshing.</td>', 'nice tones. one of those accidents that turned out well? the perspective is unusual and refreshing.', '2006-03-18 05:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237171, 304911, 17507, '<td valign="top">god that leg hair is sexy.</td>', 'god that leg hair is sexy.', '2006-03-18 05:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237172, 306609, 17507, '<td valign="top">where is the focal point?<br/>I would guess it''s meant to be the bottom of the shoe, but the hot spot above it is very distracting. Try to control your light so that your intended focal point is adequately lit.</td>', 'where is the focal point?I would guess it''s meant to be the bottom of the shoe, but the hot spot above it is very distracting. Try to control your light so that your intended focal point is adequately lit.', '2006-03-18 05:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237173, 306431, 17507, '<td valign="top">those are pretty hideous.</td>', 'those are pretty hideous.', '2006-03-18 05:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237174, 306668, 17507, '<td valign="top">pretty sweet. If only the microphone were in focus as well.</td>', 'pretty sweet. If only the microphone were in focus as well.', '2006-03-18 05:55:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2237177, 305683, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice use of perspective.</td>', 'nice use of perspective.', '2006-03-18 05:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237178, 305037, 17507, '<td valign="top">good use of leading lines. this is a strong, dynamic image. Not so much a fan of the title; it seems kind of lame.</td>', 'good use of leading lines. this is a strong, dynamic image. Not so much a fan of the title; it seems kind of lame.', '2006-03-18 05:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237179, 306032, 17507, '<td valign="top">I''M AFRAID I ONLY SEE ONE.</td>', 'I''M AFRAID I ONLY SEE ONE.', '2006-03-18 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237183, 306010, 17507, '<td valign="top">This picture, quite simply, is boring. There are no strong leading lines, no interesting (or even whole) shapes, aside from the lettering, there''s no real use of color, no apparent concept behind the image, and no reason for me to keep looking at it.</td>', 'This picture, quite simply, is boring. There are no strong leading lines, no interesting (or even whole) shapes, aside from the lettering, there''s no real use of color, no apparent concept behind the image, and no reason for me to keep looking at it.', '2006-03-18 05:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237184, 306946, 17507, '<td valign="top">Elegant color combination. I find myself distracted by the plastic thing (or whatever it is) they are sitting on.</td>', 'Elegant color combination. I find myself distracted by the plastic thing (or whatever it is) they are sitting on.', '2006-03-18 05:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237185, 306200, 17507, '<td valign="top">It took me longer than I think it should have to notice the frog. The red on red isn''t so easy to see. If the frog''s the point of the picture, I think it should have been easier to see, and it would have been okay to have part, instead of all, of the shoe in the frame.</td>', 'It took me longer than I think it should have to notice the frog. The red on red isn''t so easy to see. If the frog''s the point of the picture, I think it should have been easier to see, and it would have been okay to have part, instead of all, of the shoe in the frame.', '2006-03-18 06:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237186, 306633, 17507, '<td valign="top">interesting use of light. since the crop is so tight on the top and bottom, I feel like it should be less centered horizontally as well. It would be interesting to see a version of this with less space on the right and more space on the left.</td>', 'interesting use of light. since the crop is so tight on the top and bottom, I feel like it should be less centered horizontally as well. It would be interesting to see a version of this with less space on the right and more space on the left.', '2006-03-18 06:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237187, 306944, 17507, '<td valign="top">great perspective and conceptually strong. too bad about the harsh light.</td>', 'great perspective and conceptually strong. too bad about the harsh light.', '2006-03-18 06:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237189, 306771, 17507, '<td valign="top">lensbaby? whatever you did, it works for me. I would have liked to see some stronger highlights and deeper shadows.</td>', 'lensbaby? whatever you did, it works for me. I would have liked to see some stronger highlights and deeper shadows.', '2006-03-18 06:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237190, 306795, 17507, '<td valign="top">goodness. I guess these are miniatures? someone has a lot of tiny shoes! I think the idea is great, but I wish the light were more even in the background. If you could have gotten a pure white, I think that would have been ideal.</td>', 'goodness. I guess these are miniatures? someone has a lot of tiny shoes! I think the idea is great, but I wish the light were more even in the background. If you could have gotten a pure white, I think that would have been ideal.', '2006-03-18 06:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237191, 304769, 17507, '<td valign="top">yellow cast seems a bit strong.</td>', 'yellow cast seems a bit strong.', '2006-03-18 06:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237193, 306434, 17507, '<td valign="top">elegantly captured. the light looks quite flat - a more contrasty processing job would, i think, have been appropriate.</td>', 'elegantly captured. the light looks quite flat - a more contrasty processing job would, i think, have been appropriate.', '2006-03-18 06:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237194, 306272, 17507, '<td valign="top">Unless I''m misinterpreting this photo, don''t you untie at the other end of the shoe? There''s an apparent conceptual contradiction between the title and the image, where the title refers to one thing (the tied laces) and the photo itself is basically of the toe end of the laces, not the tie.</td>', 'Unless I''m misinterpreting this photo, don''t you untie at the other end of the shoe? There''s an apparent conceptual contradiction between the title and the image, where the title refers to one thing (the tied laces) and the photo itself is basically of the toe end of the laces, not the tie.', '2006-03-18 06:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237207, 306180, 52675, '<td valign="top">Should have saved this shot for the low key entry.</td>', 'Should have saved this shot for the low key entry.', '2006-03-18 06:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237209, 306935, 52675, '<td valign="top">Your design is good but because of the lighting there is no pleasing point of interest. your eye goes to the label on the heel.</td>', 'Your design is good but because of the lighting there is no pleasing point of interest. your eye goes to the label on the heel.', '2006-03-18 06:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2237215, 306710, 52675, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the angle and the snow on the bottom of the shoe. Perfect.</td>', 'Great shot. I love the angle and the snow on the bottom of the shoe. Perfect.', '2006-03-18 07:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
