(2239394, 306821, 48761, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... why is she so sad?  She doesn''t look to me to be thinking about running.  What does the teddy have to do with thinking, running, or shoes?  How does the wrinkled sheet fit in?  When I think about running, I do it in my house, or on my patio, putting on my shoes.  Why is one leg rolled up and the other not?  It''s got a lot of good elements (in fact, all the ones I just mentioned are good elements), but better suited for an "emotive" challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm... why is she so sad?  She doesn''t look to me to be thinking about running.  What does the teddy have to do with thinking, running, or shoes?  How does the wrinkled sheet fit in?  When I think about running, I do it in my house, or on my patio, putting on my shoes.  Why is one leg rolled up and the other not?  It''s got a lot of good elements (in fact, all the ones I just mentioned are good elements), but better suited for an "emotive" challenge.', '2006-03-19 16:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
