(2243016, 305037, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great POV here. I would have preferred a faster shutter speed so that the focus is more on the toe part of the shoe rather than the middle. But in itself, a rather striking and klick ass image ;)</td>', 'Great POV here. I would have preferred a faster shutter speed so that the focus is more on the toe part of the shoe rather than the middle. But in itself, a rather striking and klick ass image ;)', '2006-03-20 22:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243021, 306636, 37893, '<td valign="top">Sexy model. I like how she looks away from teh camera. My only comment would be her pose. I think it would have been better had she struck a 3/4 pose so that her shoulder is flung forward where her back is visible and the shoes - which are important. 8</td>', 'Sexy model. I like how she looks away from teh camera. My only comment would be her pose. I think it would have been better had she struck a 3/4 pose so that her shoulder is flung forward where her back is visible and the shoes - which are important. 8', '2006-03-20 23:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243025, 305862, 37893, '<td valign="top">Hehehehehe. Was this an outtake for the education challenge? Great image. The crop is different but effective. Somehow I wish her french manicure wasn''t there. Red nails would have made this more impactful since it would match her very lovely toes. Great job. Good luck. This will be up there.</td>', 'Hehehehehe. Was this an outtake for the education challenge? Great image. The crop is different but effective. Somehow I wish her french manicure wasn''t there. Red nails would have made this more impactful since it would match her very lovely toes. Great job. Good luck. This will be up there.', '2006-03-20 23:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243027, 306272, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Great tonal values and would be perfect for the low key challenge ;)</td>', 'Nicely done. Great tonal values and would be perfect for the low key challenge ;)', '2006-03-20 23:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
