(2246000, 305485, 34114, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who voted in this challenge and especially to those who voted for mine in a favourable way! And to everyone who commented - a big thank you.<br/>Also big thanks to my daughter who at 12 was very patient as I spent 2 hours doing her feet up.<br/>I decorated them as an Indian bride would do on her wedding day. I used liquid eyeliner rather than henna and jewellery.<br/>It''s fantastic winning my first ribbon!</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who voted in this challenge and especially to those who voted for mine in a favourable way! And to everyone who commented - a big thank you.Also big thanks to my daughter who at 12 was very patient as I spent 2 hours doing her feet up.I decorated them as an Indian bride would do on her wedding day. I used liquid eyeliner rather than henna and jewellery.It''s fantastic winning my first ribbon!', '2006-03-22 00:28:31.000000', NULL, 0),
