(2246089, 306469, 49672, '<td valign="top">Whew...I needed confirmation that most voters are idiots, and your low placing confirms it.  This photo is good on so many levels, and was one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Whew...I needed confirmation that most voters are idiots, and your low placing confirms it.  This photo is good on so many levels, and was one of the best in the challenge.', '2006-03-22 00:44:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2246110, 306790, 53964, '<td valign="top">It''s funny, I never imagined that people wouldn''t be able to see/infer/guess that these are slippers. Footwear challenge, what else could they be???  But I live in a household where odd/weird/slightly skewed is the norm so my mind naturally tends to slide a little off-center. I even discarded one of my shots because I didn''t like the black line down the backs where the opening showed... should have used that one, I guess!<br/>Thanks to those who took the time for a second and even a third look. Some figured it out eventually, some didn''t, but I appreciate those who made the effort and didn''t dismiss it out of hand. <br/>I still had a blast doing this picture, I like it, and I learned lots, both technically and about what viewers here want/like. Thanks again, even if I didn''t QUITE get the brown!</td>', 'It''s funny, I never imagined that people wouldn''t be able to see/infer/guess that these are slippers. Footwear challenge, what else could they be???  But I live in a household where odd/weird/slightly skewed is the norm so my mind naturally tends to slide a little off-center. I even discarded one of my shots because I didn''t like the black line down the backs where the opening showed... should have used that one, I guess!Thanks to those who took the time for a second and even a third look. Some figured it out eventually, some didn''t, but I appreciate those who made the effort and didn''t dismiss it out of hand. I still had a blast doing this picture, I like it, and I learned lots, both technically and about what viewers here want/like. Thanks again, even if I didn''t QUITE get the brown!', '2006-03-22 00:47:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2246113, 305143, 49672, '<td valign="top">Hey, look at that.  My comment got a comment!  Anyway, this was my top pick in the challenge, too bad voters are dumb.</td>', 'Hey, look at that.  My comment got a comment!  Anyway, this was my top pick in the challenge, too bad voters are dumb.', '2006-03-22 00:48:14.000000', NULL, 0),
