(2246882, 306613, 35602, '<td valign="top">I just happened to look at this one in the challenge results.  I did not vote (didn''t have time) but when I looked at it I figured immediately it was most likely a sacred place.  Your image was fascinating, but it lacked focus and detail.  What settings did you do on your camera?  I know what the H1 is capable of  and maybe I can help you find the right settings.  E-mail me or private message me and maybe I can help you when you enter the next challenge.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I just happened to look at this one in the challenge results.  I did not vote (didn''t have time) but when I looked at it I figured immediately it was most likely a sacred place.  Your image was fascinating, but it lacked focus and detail.  What settings did you do on your camera?  I know what the H1 is capable of  and maybe I can help you find the right settings.  E-mail me or private message me and maybe I can help you when you enter the next challenge. ', '2006-03-22 08:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2246891, 306636, 9821, '<td valign="top">this shot is unbelievably good ... true, it doesn''t have much to do with footwear ... but still unbelievably good.<br/> <br/>i do a lot of portrait studying (my fav type of photography), and your stuff is just as good as the very best i''ve ever seen.<br/> <br/>you deserve your status here on dpc ... freakin awesome job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-22 13:00:13.</i></td>', 'this shot is unbelievably good ... true, it doesn''t have much to do with footwear ... but still unbelievably good. i do a lot of portrait studying (my fav type of photography), and your stuff is just as good as the very best i''ve ever seen. you deserve your status here on dpc ... freakin awesome job!', '2006-03-22 08:33:32.000000', '2006-03-22 13:00:13.000000', 0),
(2246943, 306786, 35602, '<td valign="top">Saw your comment under footwear.  Well, I did not vote on this one due to lack of time, but really consider this a learning experience.  It was definitely too soft a focus for the folks here.  Though your details are still there, I think you also may have suffered from that horrible malady of which I have been suffering from, subject interest.  Most folks probably thought it was too snapshotish and uninteresting, so they would have scored lower.  The photo can be absolutely wonderfully detailed and sharp (see my entry Out Of My Gourd) but if they find it uninteresting, your score will reflect that.  Your photo may have done better if you took the slippers off, and painted your toenails, then shot from a different angle where the toenails were quite clear and the butterfly and bracelet also.  Your color is quite good on this one considering you used ISO 400 and there is not an ounce of discernable grain, two things to keep in mind when you are shooting for future challenges.  Might allow you to take some lower light setups, which I can''t do because I get a lot of grain and bad color.</td>', 'Saw your comment under footwear.  Well, I did not vote on this one due to lack of time, but really consider this a learning experience.  It was definitely too soft a focus for the folks here.  Though your details are still there, I think you also may have suffered from that horrible malady of which I have been suffering from, subject interest.  Most folks probably thought it was too snapshotish and uninteresting, so they would have scored lower.  The photo can be absolutely wonderfully detailed and sharp (see my entry Out Of My Gourd) but if they find it uninteresting, your score will reflect that.  Your photo may have done better if you took the slippers off, and painted your toenails, then shot from a different angle where the toenails were quite clear and the butterfly and bracelet also.  Your color is quite good on this one considering you used ISO 400 and there is not an ounce of discernable grain, two things to keep in mind when you are shooting for future challenges.  Might allow you to take some lower light setups, which I can''t do because I get a lot of grain and bad color.', '2006-03-22 10:26:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2246957, 306786, 42615, '<td valign="top">thank you ladymonarda, for you very informative comments.  I truley appreciate your time. Congrats on your top 20!</td>', 'thank you ladymonarda, for you very informative comments.  I truley appreciate your time. Congrats on your top 20!', '2006-03-22 10:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
