(2248346, 304690, 40370, '<td valign="top">Glad to see your "unique" effect worked, I love the blue/green duotone and "logo" quality of your image. Like other commenters have said, sometimes post-processing backfires (mine for example, I thought high contrast would make my otherwise boring garage set-up more interesting) but I think you have done a fine job here in a rather "ordinary" challenge.</td>', 'Glad to see your "unique" effect worked, I love the blue/green duotone and "logo" quality of your image. Like other commenters have said, sometimes post-processing backfires (mine for example, I thought high contrast would make my otherwise boring garage set-up more interesting) but I think you have done a fine job here in a rather "ordinary" challenge.', '2006-03-22 17:26:46.000000', NULL, 0),
