(2248390, 306180, 29020, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all positive reviews, and the constructive critisism. I had a feeling that this shot would not work great on all monitors, but decided to go with it anyway. Never really worked with low key shots before so I have a lot to learn, and thanks to you - a little less!</td>', 'Thanks for all positive reviews, and the constructive critisism. I had a feeling that this shot would not work great on all monitors, but decided to go with it anyway. Never really worked with low key shots before so I have a lot to learn, and thanks to you - a little less!', '2006-03-22 17:34:12.000000', NULL, 0),
