(2248468, 306790, 42125, '<td valign="top">Love this one!<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hideout:</b></div><hr/><i> Maybe those are slippers? Please don''t tell me you bought a whole box of bananas for this challenge. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Love this one!Originally posted by hideout: Maybe those are slippers? Please don''t tell me you bought a whole box of bananas for this challenge. ', '2006-03-22 17:45:35.000000', NULL, 0),
