(2249087, 306790, 53964, '<td valign="top">Lol, yeah me too. And nope, only bought two bunches! Actually my first setup was with the monkeys amongst tropical-type plants but I wasn''t happy with it. My daughter had been reorganising her room and had left a banana box of books within sightline of my computer. I just stuck two bananas in front of the holes to mostly hide the books and set the others on top of the books.</td>', 'Lol, yeah me too. And nope, only bought two bunches! Actually my first setup was with the monkeys amongst tropical-type plants but I wasn''t happy with it. My daughter had been reorganising her room and had left a banana box of books within sightline of my computer. I just stuck two bananas in front of the holes to mostly hide the books and set the others on top of the books.', '2006-03-22 20:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
