(2250400, 305620, 50674, '<td valign="top">Nokia (1865) actually started in the lumber business. Then went on to rubber and to cables. For most Scandinavians, Nokia wellies were a part of our lives, in the same way as Nokia cellphones are today.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-23 05:37:18.</i></td>', 'Nokia (1865) actually started in the lumber business. Then went on to rubber and to cables. For most Scandinavians, Nokia wellies were a part of our lives, in the same way as Nokia cellphones are today.', '2006-03-23 05:36:50.000000', '2006-03-23 05:37:18.000000', 0),
(2250425, 305485, 31905, '<td valign="top">cant make out the colors but an Indian bride will never paint her nails black. Infact very rarely you will see any indian wear black to a wedding.<br/> <br/>nice take ... I really loved it.<br/> <br/>The process of applying the Henna is called the Mehndi ki Rasam. Its a whole day affair ... one of the many ceremonies before the day of the marriage.<br/> <br/></td>', 'cant make out the colors but an Indian bride will never paint her nails black. Infact very rarely you will see any indian wear black to a wedding. nice take ... I really loved it. The process of applying the Henna is called the Mehndi ki Rasam. Its a whole day affair ... one of the many ceremonies before the day of the marriage. ', '2006-03-23 06:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
