(2253139, 305478, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club* <br/> <br/>"Social Climber ..." is a nice idea in the Footwear challenge.  I think footwear was a though challenge since we recently had a Shoes challenge.  So at least we had different ideas, and  yours was one of them.  <br/> <br/> <br/>I think you had a great idea, the concept may have been a little lost on viewers.  I know I had a hard time with the boots in the tree.  I could see a progression of dress shoes up a ladder or stairs.   The image itself is well taken.  The focus seems pretty clear.  The colors are nice and natural, you might turn to adjust the contrast a little to give it a little edge.  The composition is not bad.  Unfortunately I really think the idea is what hurt the voters people not understanding or taking the time to look.  I look forward to your future challenges.</td>', '*Critique Club*  "Social Climber ..." is a nice idea in the Footwear challenge.  I think footwear was a though challenge since we recently had a Shoes challenge.  So at least we had different ideas, and  yours was one of them.    I think you had a great idea, the concept may have been a little lost on viewers.  I know I had a hard time with the boots in the tree.  I could see a progression of dress shoes up a ladder or stairs.   The image itself is well taken.  The focus seems pretty clear.  The colors are nice and natural, you might turn to adjust the contrast a little to give it a little edge.  The composition is not bad.  Unfortunately I really think the idea is what hurt the voters people not understanding or taking the time to look.  I look forward to your future challenges.', '2006-03-23 23:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2253175, 305485, 22459, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, congratulation on the blue ribbon</td>', 'Excellent image, congratulation on the blue ribbon', '2006-03-23 23:58:32.000000', NULL, 0),
