(2254911, 304690, 54455, '<td valign="top">I love the post-processing and the composition.  I found your photo to be an eye-catcher and enjoy looking at it.  After reading your notes on what you were trying to achieve, I''d say you did...and created a piece of art, not just a picture.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the post-processing and the composition.  I found your photo to be an eye-catcher and enjoy looking at it.  After reading your notes on what you were trying to achieve, I''d say you did...and created a piece of art, not just a picture.  Well done!', '2006-03-24 12:51:42.000000', NULL, 0),
