(2255352, 306636, 18202, '<td valign="top">Well, I''ve seen worse.. :)<br/>This photo is a classic, I''ve seen similar photos in some magazines a while ago and I always loved them - yours is no exception.<br/> <br/>I think going with a pair of shoes in a different color might''ve created a more dramatic effect though.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work and it''s good to have you back in here.</td>', 'Well, I''ve seen worse.. :)This photo is a classic, I''ve seen similar photos in some magazines a while ago and I always loved them - yours is no exception. I think going with a pair of shoes in a different color might''ve created a more dramatic effect though. Keep up the good work and it''s good to have you back in here.', '2006-03-24 14:47:21.000000', NULL, 0),
