(2519877, 306482, 51538, '<td valign="top">That was quite a find.  Serendipity plays a part in photos, as does the viewer''s viewpoint.  Although the main subject of the challenge is not as in good focus or exposure as on might hope - it was and is as good as can be expected in such conditions.  Between shadows, say under a bridge, and full blast sunlight there is a huge dynamic range.</td>', 'That was quite a find.  Serendipity plays a part in photos, as does the viewer''s viewpoint.  Although the main subject of the challenge is not as in good focus or exposure as on might hope - it was and is as good as can be expected in such conditions.  Between shadows, say under a bridge, and full blast sunlight there is a huge dynamic range.', '2006-06-15 11:32:08.000000', NULL, 0),
