(5979054, 304838, 47974, '<td valign="top">Did not vote in this challenge.  I like the photograph but it is way to small and that will really effect the vote.  Make sure you use photographs of the max size of 800 pixels on the longest size. If I have voted I would have given you a 6 or 7 if it was bigger.  Being that it is so small I would have given a 1 or 2 with a comment about using a larger size picture.</td>', 'Did not vote in this challenge.  I like the photograph but it is way to small and that will really effect the vote.  Make sure you use photographs of the max size of 800 pixels on the longest size. If I have voted I would have given you a 6 or 7 if it was bigger.  Being that it is so small I would have given a 1 or 2 with a comment about using a larger size picture.', '2010-04-29 11:53:43.000000', NULL, 0),
